I look at my family on the screen.
They are in Mexico, and I am in Copenhagen.
They are all smiling.
I am so happy to see them.
But I am also a little sad.
I look at them all.
"I miss you all," I say quietly.
My mother looks at me.
Her smile is warm.
"We miss you too, sweetheart," she says.
"But we are proud of you."
I smile.
It is a warm moment.
My family is close tonight.
